AgentConductor

Commands:
  ui-new <workspace-dir>
  ui <run-dir>
  profiles <profiles.json>
  models-discover <profiles.json> <agent-id> <new-discovery-dir>
  catalog-import <profiles.json> <agent-id> <observed-catalog.json>
  plan <profiles.json> <coordinator-id> <repo> <new-plan-dir> <goal> [roles.json] [--from plan.md] [--rules rules.md] [--phases slug-dir]
  sessions <run-dir>
  briefing <run-dir>
  checkpoint-issue <run-dir> <issue.json>
  checkpoint-poll <run-dir> <address.json>
  checkpoint-ack <run-dir> <ack.json>
  checkpoint-report <run-dir> <progress.json>
  quota-refresh <run-dir> <agent-id>
  schedule <run-dir> <task-id> <YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS+HH:MM>
  reassign <run-dir> <task-id> <agent-id> [model]
  session-model <run-dir> <task-id> <model>
  stop <run-dir> <reason>
  resume <run-dir>
  recover <run-dir>
  resume-due <run-dir>
  watch <run-dir>
  validate <plan.json>
  run <plan.json> <repo> <new-run-dir> <approved-plan-digest> [--phase slug-dir phase-id]
  status <run-dir>
  update
  logs <run-dir> <task-id>
  progress <run-dir> <task-id>
  diff <run-dir>
  tool-requests <run-dir>
  tool-refresh <run-dir> <exact-request-sha256>
  tool-approve <run-dir> <exact-request-sha256> [lifetime-seconds]
  tool-reject <run-dir> <exact-request-sha256>
  approve <run-dir> <exact-candidate-sha>
  reject <run-dir> <reason>
  revise <run-dir> <task-id> <feedback>
  review <run-dir> <coordinator-id>
  review-apply <run-dir> <coordinator-id>
  apply-review <run-dir> <exact-proposal-sha256>
  merge <run-dir>
  knowledge-digest <lesson.json>
  knowledge-accept <run-dir> <lesson.json> <exact-digest>
  knowledge-status <run-dir>
  recall <run-dir> <query>
  memory-sync <run-dir> <local-port>
  memory-publish <local-port> <envelope.json>
  memory-read <local-port> <memory-id>
  memory-import <run-dir> <local-port> <memory-id>
  memory-discover <run-dir> <local-port>
  normalize <claude|codex|opencode|custom> <stdout.jsonl>

Shared workspace is default; worktrees are optional. Run directories must be outside the repository.
Review profiles, scopes and test commands before passing the validate command's plan digest.
Profiles need an operator-verified sandbox/permission configuration before execution.
